<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= try_index_of \\* b c {number}. (item : b) (list : list b) : option c =\n    := ^ 루프 \\* a {number}. (i : a) : list b -> option a = \\|\n        | [] => None\n        | x :: xs => ? x = item ?> Some i |: 루프 (i + 1) xs\n    루프 0 list\n\n:= index_of item =\n    try_index_of item >> optionm::value\n\n:= try_index_of_ \\* b c {number}. (item : b) (list : list b) : option c =\n    :~ ^ 루프 \\* a {number}. (i : a) : list b -> option a = \\|\n        | [] => None\n        | x :: xs =>\n            ? x = item\n            ?> Some i\n            |: 루프 (i + 1) xs\n    루프 0 list\n\n:= index_of_ item =\n    try_index_of_ item >> optionm::value\n\n:= try_index_of__ item list =\n    := i = mut 0\n    := list = mut list\n    := result = mut None\n    :~ ^ 루프 () =\n        ?= *list ?|\n        | [] => result <- None\n        | x :: xs =>\n            ? x = item\n            ?> result <- Some *i\n            |:\n                i <- *i + 1\n                list <- xs\n                루프 ()\n    루프 ()\n    *result\n\n:= index_of__ item =\n    try_index_of__ item >> optionm::value","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := try_index_of \* b c {number}. (item : b) (list : list b) : option c =
      := ^ 루프 \* a {number}. (i : a) : list b -> option a = \|
          | [] => None
          | x :: xs => ? x = item ?> Some i |: 루프 (i + 1) xs
      루프 0 list

  := index_of item =
      try_index_of item >> optionm::value

  := try_index_of_ \* b c {number}. (item : b) (list : list b) : option c =
      :~ ^ 루프 \* a {number}. (i : a) : list b -> option a = \|
          | [] => None
          | x :: xs =>
              ? x = item
              ?> Some i
              |: 루프 (i + 1) xs
      루프 0 list

  := index_of_ item =
      try_index_of_ item >> optionm::value

  := try_index_of__ item list =
      := i = mut 0
      := list = mut list
      := result = mut None
      :~ ^ 루프 () =
          ?= *list ?|
          | [] => result <- None
          | x :: xs =>
              ? x = item
              ?> result <- Some *i
              |:
                  i <- *i + 1
                  list <- xs
                  루프 ()
      루프 ()
      *result

  := index_of__ item =
      try_index_of__ item >> optionm::value
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

