<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= try_find fn list =\n    := ^ 루프 = \\|\n        | [] => None\n        | x :: xs =>\n            ? fn x\n            ?> Some x\n            |: 루프 xs\n    루프 list\n\n:= try_find_ fn list =\n    :~ ^ 루프 = \\|\n        | [] => None\n        | x :: xs =>\n            ? fn x\n            ?> Some x\n            |: 루프 xs\n    루프 list","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := try_find fn list =
      := ^ 루프 = \|
          | [] => None
          | x :: xs =>
              ? fn x
              ?> Some x
              |: 루프 xs
      루프 list

  := try_find_ fn list =
      :~ ^ 루프 = \|
          | [] => None
          | x :: xs =>
              ? fn x
              ?> Some x
              |: 루프 xs
      루프 list
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

