<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= filter \\* t. (fn : t -> bool) (list : list t) : list t =\n    (list, [])\n    ||> listm::foldBack \\ x acc =>\n        ? fn x ?> x :: acc |: acc\n\n:= zip_with fn xs ys =\n    := ^ 루프 acc xs ys =\n        ?= xs, ys ?|\n        | (x :: xs), (y :: ys) =>\n            루프 (fn x y :: acc) xs ys\n        | _ => listm::rev acc\n    루프 [] xs ys\n\n:= zip_with_ fn xs ys =\n    :~ ^ 루프 acc xs ys =\n        ?= xs, ys ?|\n        | (x :: xs), (y :: ys) =>\n            루프 (fn x y :: acc) xs ys\n        | _ => listm::rev acc\n    루프 [] xs ys","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := filter \* t. (fn : t -> bool) (list : list t) : list t =
      (list, [])
      ||> listm::foldBack \ x acc =>
          ? fn x ?> x :: acc |: acc

  := zip_with fn xs ys =
      := ^ 루프 acc xs ys =
          ?= xs, ys ?|
          | (x :: xs), (y :: ys) =>
              루프 (fn x y :: acc) xs ys
          | _ => listm::rev acc
      루프 [] xs ys

  := zip_with_ fn xs ys =
      :~ ^ 루프 acc xs ys =
          ?= xs, ys ?|
          | (x :: xs), (y :: ys) =>
              루프 (fn x y :: acc) xs ys
          | _ => listm::rev acc
      루프 [] xs ys
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

