<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= try_pick fn list =\n    := ^ body fn = \\|\n        | [] => None\n        | x :: xs =>\n            ?= fn x ?|\n            | Some y => Some y\n            | None => 루프 xs\n    :& := 루프 list =\n        ? var_is list |> not\n        ?> body fn list\n        |:\n            := fn = ~~ fn\n            := list = dyn list\n            ~~ body fn list\n    루프 list","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := try_pick fn list =
      := ^ body fn = \|
          | [] => None
          | x :: xs =>
              ?= fn x ?|
              | Some y => Some y
              | None => 루프 xs
      :& := 루프 list =
          ? var_is list |> not
          ?> body fn list
          |:
              := fn = ~~ fn
              := list = dyn list
              ~~ body fn list
      루프 list
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

