<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= to_array' \\* t. (items : list' t) : array_base t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!items |> spiral_array_from_list' : array_base t\n        Lua = \\ () =>\n            := len = $'##(!items)' : i32\n            := d = ~> defaultof `t ()\n            := result : array t = arraym::init len \\ _ => d\n            :~ ^ 루프 i =\n                ? i >= len ?>\n                    := (array result) = result\n                    result\n                |:\n                    set result i (lua_list_item i items)\n                    루프 (i + 1i32)\n            루프 0i32\n        Fsharp = \\ () => items |> $'List.toArray' : array_base t\n        Python = \\ () =>\n            := len = $'len(!items)' : i32\n            := result : array t = array ($'__import__(\"numpy\").empty(!len, dtype=object)' : array_base t)\n            :~ ^ 루프 i =\n                ? i >= len ?>\n                    := (array result) = result\n                    result\n                |:\n                    set result i $'!items[!i]'\n                    루프 (i + 1i32)\n            루프 0i32\n        Rust = \\ () => $'Rc::new(RefCell::new((!items).as_ref().clone()))' : array_base t\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'[...!items]' : array_base t\n        Zig = \\ () => $'(spiral_gpa.dupe(`t, !items) catch @@panic(\"out of memory\"))' : array_base t\n    }\n\n:= contains \\* t. (item : t) (list : list t) : bool =\n    list\n    |> try_index_of_ item\n    |> \\ x => x : _ int\n    |> (<>) None\n\n:= pairwise \\* t. (list : list t) : list (t * t) =\n    :~ ^ 루프 = \\|\n        | (x1 : t) :: x2 :: xs => (x1, x2) :: 루프 (x2 :: xs)\n        | _ => []\n    루프 list\n\n:= take_ \\* t. (n : i32) (l : list t) : list t =\n    :~ ^ taken (n : i32) (l : list t) : list t =\n        ?= l ?|\n        | x :: xs ?& n > 0i32 => x :: taken (n - 1i32) xs\n        | _ => []\n    taken n l\n\n:~ ^ skip_ \\* t. (n : i32) (items : list t) : list t =\n    ?= items ?|\n    | _ :: rest ?& n > 0i32 => skip_ (n - 1i32) rest\n    | _ => items\n\n:~ ^ chunks_ \\* t. (n : i32) (items : list t) : list (list t) =\n    ?= items ?|\n    | [] => []\n    | _ ?& n <= 0i32 => [ items ]\n    | _ => take_ n items :: chunks_ n (skip_ n items)\n\n:= chunk_sizes (l : list (list i32)) : list i32 = l |> listm::map \\ (c : list i32) => listm::length c","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := to_array' \* t. (items : list' t) : array_base t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () => $'!items |> spiral_array_from_list' : array_base t
          Lua = \ () =>
              := len = $'##(!items)' : i32
              := d = ~> defaultof `t ()
              := result : array t = arraym::init len \ _ => d
              :~ ^ 루프 i =
                  ? i >= len ?>
                      := (array result) = result
                      result
                  |:
                      set result i (lua_list_item i items)
                      루프 (i + 1i32)
              루프 0i32
          Fsharp = \ () => items |> $'List.toArray' : array_base t
          Python = \ () =>
              := len = $'len(!items)' : i32
              := result : array t = array ($'__import__("numpy").empty(!len, dtype=object)' : array_base t)
              :~ ^ 루프 i =
                  ? i >= len ?>
                      := (array result) = result
                      result
                  |:
                      set result i $'!items[!i]'
                      루프 (i + 1i32)
              루프 0i32
          Rust = \ () => $'Rc::new(RefCell::new((!items).as_ref().clone()))' : array_base t
          TypeScript = \ () => $'[...!items]' : array_base t
          Zig = \ () => $'(spiral_gpa.dupe(`t, !items) catch @@panic("out of memory"))' : array_base t
      }

  := contains \* t. (item : t) (list : list t) : bool =
      list
      |> try_index_of_ item
      |> \ x => x : _ int
      |> (<>) None

  := pairwise \* t. (list : list t) : list (t * t) =
      :~ ^ 루프 = \|
          | (x1 : t) :: x2 :: xs => (x1, x2) :: 루프 (x2 :: xs)
          | _ => []
      루프 list

  := take_ \* t. (n : i32) (l : list t) : list t =
      :~ ^ taken (n : i32) (l : list t) : list t =
          ?= l ?|
          | x :: xs ?& n > 0i32 => x :: taken (n - 1i32) xs
          | _ => []
      taken n l

  :~ ^ skip_ \* t. (n : i32) (items : list t) : list t =
      ?= items ?|
      | _ :: rest ?& n > 0i32 => skip_ (n - 1i32) rest
      | _ => items

  :~ ^ chunks_ \* t. (n : i32) (items : list t) : list (list t) =
      ?= items ?|
      | [] => []
      | _ ?& n <= 0i32 => [ items ]
      | _ => take_ n items :: chunks_ n (skip_ n items)

  := chunk_sizes (l : list (list i32)) : list i32 = l |> listm::map \ (c : list i32) => listm::length c
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### chunks_split_into_runs_of_at_most_n (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> gleam\n\n:= ~items = [ 1i32; 2; 3; 4; 5 ]\n(chunk_sizes (chunks_ 2i32 items), chunk_sizes (chunks_ 0i32 items)) |> _assert_eq ([ 2i32; 2; 1 ], [ 5i32 ])","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust
  ///> gleam

  := ~items = [ 1i32; 2; 3; 4; 5 ]
  (chunk_sizes (chunks_ 2i32 items), chunk_sizes (chunks_ 0i32 items)) |> _assert_eq ([ 2i32; 2; 1 ], [ 5i32 ])
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

