#### take_stops_at_the_count_or_the_end (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> gleam\n\n:= ~n = 2i32\n(taken_count n [ 1i32; 2; 3 ], taken_count 5i32 [ 1i32 ], taken_count (-1i32) [ 1i32 ])\n|> _assert_eq (2i32, 1i32, 0i32)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust
  ///> gleam

  := ~n = 2i32
  (taken_count n [ 1i32; 2; 3 ], taken_count 5i32 [ 1i32 ], taken_count (-1i32) [ 1i32 ])
  |> _assert_eq (2i32, 1i32, 0i32)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

